# nicolae_tomb_entry_rubble_hallway is a source-authored tomb_entry map. Its MAP is unchanged; named Lua hooks replace source script lines at their original positions.
NAME: nicolae_tomb_entry_rubble_hallway
ORIENT: float
TAGS: tomb_entry no_monster_gen no_item_gen no_wall_fixup
NSUBST: R = 7:r / *:.
SUBST: r = xx..., . = ....s
KITEM: s = stone q:1 / large rock q:1 w:5
RTILE: x = wall_pebble_darkgray
KFEAT: O = enter_tomb
MAP
ccccccccccccccccc
cccccccccccr...rc
c..rrr.rrr..RRR.c
+.r.r.r.r.rrROR.c
c.rr.rrr.rr.RRR.c
cccccccccccr...rc
ccccccccccccccccc
ENDMAP
